'''Makoto Tsumura''' (Japanese: '''津村まこと''' ''Tsumura Makoto'') is a Japanese voice actress for {{aniseries|PTS}}. She was born on July 22, 1965 in {{wp|Hokkaido}}, {{wp|Japan}}.

==Pokémon roles==
Tsumura began to provide voices for Pokémon in {{aniseries|GS}}. Her most important role in {{aniseries|PTS}} is that of [[Johanna]] in {{aniseries|DP}}.
